            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki olmalaika obo le lelo oopishana ooata ilbakulini oopishana alotu enatii naajoki, “Wou, maaitoduaa nanu iyie enkiguana nadung'okini ena mulayoi kitok, natonita too nkariak kumok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.23.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 23.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa te ninye etololoitore ilaiguanak le nkop naa te naisho e loloito enye etemerate lelo ootii enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 13.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naaya ninye nanu te nkiyang'et ong'ata nadol enkitok natonita te nkoriong e ng'ues nanyokie nabore nkarn e morore neeta lukuny naapishana o mowuarak tomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.51.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 51.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netukusoki ina kitok too nkilani morijo o naanyokie. Neikodi te sahabu o too ntoto sidain o museitani naagol o too lului. Neibung'ita te nkaina enye enkikompe e sahabu nabore olminong o loirerioni le loloito enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lpura le nkomom enye neigero enkarna e nkisudoroto: “Babilon kitok, ngoto mulayoni o ilo minong le nkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadol ina kitok etemere to sarge loo sinyat le Enkai o to sarge loo lchakenini le Yesu. Ore pee adol nanu ninye naing'asia oleng.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aatiaaka olmalaika, “Ainyoo pee ing'asia? Kaaliki taata enkisudoroto e na kitok, o ene ina ng'ues naata lukuny naapishana o mowuarak tomon nanapita ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 69.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ina ng'ues nitoduaa keetae apa, nemeekure eetae. Naa kepuku ailepu te ngumoto nemeeta enkiting'oto nelo atua enkidaaroto. Ore lelo oomanya enkop leitu esiri inkarn enye te mbuku e mpuaan ebaiki apa pee eitamanyuni enkop naa keing'asia te nedol ina ng'ues, amu etii apa, nemeetii taata, naa kelotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyieu ena eng'eno nagut. Ore nena lukuny naapishana naa ildoinyo oopishana ootonita ina kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ilaiguanak oopishana sii. Netabatatate imiet lenye, netii obo, neton eitu elotu olikae, naa ore te nelotu meeta nchere pee me nkiti kata ake eton. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina ng'ues apa natii nemetii taata, naa ene isiet kake ene nena naapishana sii, naa kelotu enkidaaroto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore nena mowuarak tomon nitoduaa naa ilaiguanak tomon leton eitu eng'amu engolon naitoreishore. Kake keng'amu engolon anaa ilaiguanak te saa nabo te nebo ina ng'ues. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ile ndamunoto nabo kulo neishoo ina ng'ues engolon o enkidimata enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayunyie olarrabal ilo kuoo le ker, nemir Olkuoo le Ker ninche, amu ninye Olaitoriani loo laitoriak naa Olaiguanani loo laiguanak, ore lelo ooboitare ninye naa keipoto negeluno neisiligayu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Ore nena ariak nitoduaa te ine netonie emulayoi naa iltung'ana o lororani o nkuapi o lng'ejepa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena mowuarak tomon nitoduaa, ore ninche o ina ng'ues keibayu ina mulayoi, nekiny ninye aitalioo meishopo, nenya nkiri o sesen lenye nepejoo ninye te nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu Enkai natipika atua oltau lenye meitabai inaayieu ninye, neaku ile ndamunoto nabo, neishooyo engolon enye, e nkitoria aaisho ina ng'ues, o metaba anaa neitabari ororei le Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina kitok nitoduaa naa ina anasa kitok naata enkitoria te shumata oo laiguanak le nkop.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
